{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47555","headline":"真人行巴陵市太守怒其不避使案吏具其罪真人曰须酒醒耳顷忽失之但留诗曰 · 吕岩","name":"真人行巴陵市太守怒其不避使案吏具其罪真人曰须酒醒耳顷忽失之但留诗曰","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暂别蓬莱海上游，偶逢太守问根由。\n身居北斗星杓下，剑挂南宫月角头。\n道我醉来真个醉，不知愁是怎生愁。\n相逢何事不相认，却驾白云归去休。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47555.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47555","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}